       fhir:ElementDefinition.short [ fhir:value "Business version of the questionnaire" ] ;
       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "The identifier that is used to identify this version of the questionnaire when it is referenced in a specification, model, design or instance. This is an arbitrary value managed by the questionnaire author and is not expected to be globally unique. For example, it might be a timestamp (e.g. yyyymmdd) if a managed version is not available. There is also no expectation that versions can be placed in a lexicographical sequence." ] ;
